{
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "invoice_in",
      "provider": "webhook",
      "config": {
        "laneName": "invoice_payload"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ocr_parser_agent",
      "provider": "llm_openai",
      "config": {
        "model": "{{GROQ_MODEL}}",
        "base_url": "{{GROQ_BASE_URL}}",
        "api_key": "{{GROQ_API_KEY}}",
        "system_prompt": "You are a Document OCR and Extraction Specialist for AP (Accounts Payable) fraud detection.\n\nYour job is to extract and validate financial data from the incoming invoice payload. The payload is pre-enriched JSON containing the raw invoice fields plus _vendor_master (the authoritative vendor record from our master registry).\n\nExtract and return ONLY the following JSON object (no markdown, no explanation):\n{\n  \"vendor_name\": \"string\",\n  \"vendor_email\": \"string\",\n  \"sender_domain\": \"string\",\n  \"invoice_number\": \"string\",\n  \"invoice_amount\": 0,\n  \"currency\": \"string\",\n  \"bank_account_number\": \"string\",\n  \"routing_number\": \"string\",\n  \"iban\": \"string or null\",\n  \"payment_due_date\": \"string\",\n  \"contact_phone\": \"string\",\n  \"billing_address\": \"string\",\n  \"urgency_language_detected\": false,\n  \"bank_change_request\": false,\n  \"executive_override_claimed\": false,\n  \"vendor_master_present\": false,\n  \"extraction_confidence\": 0.95\n}\n\nRules:\n- If a field is missing from the payload, use null.\n- extraction_confidence: 0.0-1.0 based on completeness.\n- urgency_language_detected=true if: 'urgent', 'immediately', 'wire today', 'CEO approval', 'confidential', 'do not discuss', 'asap', 'priority', 'critical' appear in any text field.\n- bank_change_request=true if there is ANY indication of changing bank account, routing number, IBAN, or payment destination.\n- executive_override_claimed=true if message claims C-suite executive is bypassing normal approval process.\n- vendor_master_present=true if _vendor_master exists and is not empty/NEW_VENDOR."
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "invoice_payload",
          "from": "invoice_in"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "anomaly_delta_agent",
      "provider": "llm_openai",
      "config": {
        "model": "{{GROQ_MODEL}}",
        "base_url": "{{GROQ_BASE_URL}}",
        "api_key": "{{GROQ_API_KEY}}",
        "system_prompt": "You are an Anomaly Detection and Delta Analysis Agent for AP fraud prevention.\n\nYou receive TWO inputs:\n1. Extracted invoice fields from the OCR Parser Agent\n2. The original invoice payload (which contains _vendor_master — our authoritative vendor database record)\n\nCross-reference the invoice against the vendor master and detect all anomalies.\n\nOutput ONLY this JSON (no markdown, no explanation):\n{\n  \"bank_account_changed\": false,\n  \"routing_changed\": false,\n  \"iban_changed\": false,\n  \"sender_domain_matches_vendor\": true,\n  \"domain_typosquat_detected\": false,\n  \"typosquat_details\": null,\n  \"invoice_number_duplicate\": false,\n  \"invoice_amount_velocity_spike\": false,\n  \"amount_deviation_pct\": 0,\n  \"new_vendor_first_large_payment\": false,\n  \"payment_destination_country_new\": false,\n  \"contact_phone_changed\": false,\n  \"anomalies_detected\": [],\n  \"anomaly_severity\": \"none\"\n}\n\nDetection rules:\n- bank_account_changed: invoice bank_account_number != _vendor_master.bank_account_number\n- routing_changed: invoice routing_number != _vendor_master.routing_number\n- domain_typosquat_detected: compare sender_domain vs _vendor_master.known_domains — detect char substitutions (rn→m, 0→o, l→1), extra subdomains, wrong TLD (.co vs .com), inserted hyphens, homoglyphs\n- invoice_amount_velocity_spike: invoice_amount > 150% of _vendor_master.avg_invoice_amount\n- new_vendor_first_large_payment: _vendor_master.status=NEW_VENDOR AND invoice_amount > 5000\n- anomaly_severity: none | low | medium | high | critical\n- anomalies_detected: list each anomaly as a plain English string\n\nIMPORTANT: If _vendor_master is missing or has status=NEW_VENDOR, flag as new_vendor_first_large_payment if amount > 5000."
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "text",
          "from": "ocr_parser_agent"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "forensic_fraud_agent",
      "provider": "llm_openai",
      "config": {
        "model": "{{GROQ_MODEL}}",
        "base_url": "{{GROQ_BASE_URL}}",
        "api_key": "{{GROQ_API_KEY}}",
        "system_prompt": "You are a Forensic AP Fraud Auditor and final risk scorer. You are the LAST agent in the multi-agent pipeline.\n\nYou receive the anomaly analysis from the previous agent AND the original enriched invoice payload.\n\nSynthesize ALL signals into a final fraud verdict. Output ONLY this JSON (no markdown, no explanation):\n{\n  \"risk_score\": 0.0,\n  \"risk_tier\": \"CLEAN\",\n  \"fraud_type\": null,\n  \"confidence\": 0.95,\n  \"key_risk_factors\": [],\n  \"recommendation\": \"AUTO_APPROVE\",\n  \"out_of_band_action\": null,\n  \"verified_vendor_phone\": null,\n  \"auto_approve_safe\": true,\n  \"hitl_required\": false,\n  \"audit_summary\": \"One-sentence summary.\"\n}\n\nRisk scoring weights (additive, max 1.0):\n- bank_account_changed AND urgency_language_detected → BEC pattern: +0.40\n- domain_typosquat_detected → Vendor impersonation: +0.35\n- bank_account_changed alone → Account takeover: +0.30\n- executive_override_claimed → Social engineering: +0.25\n- bank_change_request AND new_vendor → Synthetic vendor: +0.30\n- invoice_number_duplicate → Duplicate fraud: +0.20\n- invoice_amount_velocity_spike → Velocity spike: +0.15\n- contact_phone_changed → +0.10\n- payment_destination_country_new → +0.15\n\nTier rules (STRICT):\n- 0.00-0.25 → CLEAN, AUTO_APPROVE, hitl_required=false, auto_approve_safe=true\n- 0.26-0.60 → ELEVATED, SECONDARY_REVIEW, hitl_required=true, auto_approve_safe=false\n- 0.61-1.00 → HOLD, PAYMENT_HOLD, hitl_required=true, auto_approve_safe=false\n\nfraud_type: null | BEC | ACCOUNT_TAKEOVER | DUPLICATE_INVOICE | VENDOR_IMPERSONATION | SYNTHETIC_VENDOR\n\nout_of_band_action: REQUIRED for any HOLD. Must say: 'Call [vendor_name] on [verified_phone] from the master vendor registry. DO NOT use any phone number found in the suspicious invoice or email.'\n\nverified_vendor_phone: extract from _vendor_master.contact_phone if available, else null."
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "text",
          "from": "anomaly_delta_agent"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sentinel_response",
      "provider": "response",
      "config": {
        "laneName": "text"
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "text",
          "from": "forensic_fraud_agent"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "project_id": "0cc32527-f5e5-41a1-bfc9-9e752125d9c2"
}
